: note: these header lines are SSE comments (start with ":") and must be ignored by a compliant parser.
: expected ModelEvents: TextDelta("Hello"), TextDelta("!"), Usage(input=25, output=15, cumulative), Completed(stop=end_turn)
: note: message_start usage output_tokens=1 is a provisional count; message_delta usage is cumulative and supersedes it.

